  uh it has been hurt by you people the  political establishment  there's a dark america out there that  needs to be changed i'm going to change  it from this day  forward it's going to be only  america first  now as biden takes office he is facing a  still divided country  a poll last month found roughly  one-third of those surveyed did not  think biden won the election  legitimately  and about the same share believed there  was widespread voter fraud  just so you understand this election was  a fraud trump has repeated both of these  false claims  he's conceded that he's not going to be  the president any longer but he has not  conceded that he lost the election  that is uh going to convey in the eyes  of millions of americans  a sense of illegitimacy about a  president biden and the biden  administration  this inauguration seems poised to hold a  unique place in our country's history  how president biden tries to speak to  people who think he is not the  legitimate next president of this  country  is going to be an important part of this  inaugural i pledge to be a president  who seeks not to divide but unify  i think people will look back on the  2021 inauguration of joe biden and say  that was the one and only inauguration  this country has ever had  that went that way i can't imagine this  set of circumstances  ever being repeated

